@library_HostAddress = http://localhost:5254

### Health
GET {{library_HostAddress}}/health

###

### Register
POST {{library_HostAddress}}/register
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "name": "alice",
  "email": "alice@example.com",
  "password": "password123"
}

###

### Login — auth is set as an httpOnly cookie; subsequent requests below are authenticated via that cookie
POST {{library_HostAddress}}/login
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "name": "alice",
  "password": "password123",
  "rememberMe": false
}

###

### Logout
POST {{library_HostAddress}}/logout

###

### Current user
GET {{library_HostAddress}}/me

###

### List books
GET {{library_HostAddress}}/books?page=1&pageSize=20

###

### Search books
GET {{library_HostAddress}}/books?search=tolkien

###

### Get book by id
GET {{library_HostAddress}}/books/1

###

### Add book manually
POST {{library_HostAddress}}/books
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "baslik": "The Hobbit",
  "yazar": "J.R.R. Tolkien",
  "isbn": "9780261102217",
  "isAvailable": true
}

###

### Import book from Open Library by ISBN
POST {{library_HostAddress}}/books/import/9780261102217

###

### Update book
PUT {{library_HostAddress}}/books/1
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "baslik": "The Hobbit",
  "yazar": "J.R.R. Tolkien",
  "isbn": "9780261102217",
  "isAvailable": false
}

###

### Delete book
DELETE {{library_HostAddress}}/books/1

###

### List users (admin only)
GET {{library_HostAddress}}/users

###
